-first argument, the remaining arguments go to `main(argv)` of `slot_links.py`:
-
-    rebase_links.py --inbound --task docs/tasks/task-<ID>-<slug>.md
-        [--plan docs/plans/plan-<ID>-<slug>.md] [--since <rev>] [--dry-run] [--json]
